=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is SnowBoard Game free?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. SnowBoard Game is free to play in the player above, with no purchase required to start. If you want to compare other free snowboard games, use the Snowboard Games collection linked in the comparison section above.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do I need to download anything?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No separate app or game client is required. Like other snowboard games online, it loads its files through your browser, so allow time for loading and keep an internet connection available. Loading browser files still uses data.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What are the controls?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Click GO to start, then use W, A, S, D or the arrow keys for movement and V for a grab. Click inside the player before using the keyboard. The controls table and five steps above explain how to begin.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I play it on my phone?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The publisher lists SnowBoard Game as mobile ready. Open the page, turn your phone sideways, and tap GO in the player. Check its instructions for touch controls on your device. If no movement or grab buttons appear, use a computer for the keyboard controls.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is it unblocked at school or work?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Access depends on your school's or workplace's network rules. A browser game can still be blocked, even when this guide loads. The site and its publisher's player both need to be allowed. Follow local rules and ask the network administrator if you are unsure.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What's the difference between SnowBoard Game and Downhill Snowboard?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"